      "side": 1,
      "message": "It may still be overkill but the primary reason for this is that I noticed a common pattern throughout the file where we call `logging.debug` and then call the function. Sometimes we print some of the arguments and sometimes we do not. The goal of this decorator is to replace all those logger calls with a decorator before the function that logs the function call but I didn\u0027t want to make that change all at once.\n\nI could remove it if that seems overly complicated. Thoughts?",
